  {
   "id": "darksiders-warmastered-edition-25081@2",
   "gameId": "darksiders-warmastered-edition-25081",
   "displayName": "Patch 2",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2016-12-07T22:52:39.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We know that we need to iron out a few issues asap and are working hard to deliver the best possible Darksiders experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Changelog",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "7th December 2016",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-VRAM / Memory leak issue fixed that made the game use up all RAM, then",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "crashing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Russian voiceovers added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Settings should now save correctly if Windows user name contains",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "non-ANSI characters",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Crash when corrupt Key mapping was read fixed. We don't know yet how",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "corrupt Key mapping files are written.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-BFA Achievement should now unlock correctly (should unlock on game start",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "if you have already earned it)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-The tutorial text explaining how to throw objects was showing the wrong",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "button for keyboard / mouse users.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "New Feature : Force saved data import",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "This allows more control over importing saved data from the original",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "game into Darksiders Warmastered Edition saved data.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Instructions for Force saved data import",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Open the file %appdata%\\kaiko\\darksiders1\\config.ini",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Add the line 'force_save_data_import=true' to the section.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When starting the game it should now always ask you whether or not",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "to import saved data, given it finds original saved data. Please note",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "that all slots that your original save contains will get overwritten in",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "the WME savedata. You can remove unwanted slots from the original saved",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "data before importing, these are files either in",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "%userprofile%\\Documents\\My Games\\Darksiders or",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "%userprofile%\\Documents\\My Games\\Darksiders\\.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please backup your darksiders1 WME saved data before force",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "importing, but make sure you store your backup outside of the steam",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "cloud folder, otherwise the game can't save any more.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are looking forward for your feedback!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
